flowchart LR
  I["Intent<br/>切换频道；上拉更早历史"]
  C["Canonical ingress<br/>Surface attach/resync + direct query"]
  H["Helix<br/>Tick -> Effect -> Persist barrier"]
  A["Authority<br/>Go HTTP / WS / SQLite / PG"]
  F["InteractionFrameV2<br/>TimelineWindowVm{channelId,anchor,items,firstUnreadMessageId?,targetMessageId?,page,state}；page 含 windowToken/hasOlder/hasNewer/hasMore"]
  PC["PC<br/>WDIO Mock -> real invoke -> dual real"]
  MOB["Mobile<br/>GN GTest -> FFI -> Venus"]
  R["Unified report<br/>command/effect/store/frame/ack/render"]

  I --> C --> H
  H --> A --> H
  H --> F
  F --> PC --> R
  F --> MOB --> R

  X["FORBIDDEN<br/>端侧业务 reducer / raw fallback / receipt 冒充终态"]
  X -.fail closed.-> PC
  X -.fail closed.-> MOB
